<title>ABU DHABI: ADNOC cuts February crude prices $2.75-$2.90.</title>
<headline>ADNOC cuts February crude prices $2.75-$2.90.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) said on Sunday it had cut the official price of its crudes lifted in February by $2.75 to $2.90 a barrel.</p>
<p>Murban, Lower Zakum and Umm Shaif were cut by $2.90 to $20.85, $20.90 and $20.60 respectively. Upper Zakum was cut $2.75 to $18.90 a barrel.</p>
</text>
